            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13724985?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This proposal introduces a way to name configuration predicates for easy reuse throughout a crate.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-rust notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"#![cfg_alias(\n    x86_linux,\n    all(any(target_arch = &quot;x86&quot;, target_arch = &quot;x86_64&quot;), target_os = &quot;linux&quot;)\n)]\n\n#[cfg(x86_linux)]\nfn foo() { /* ... */ }\n#[cfg(not(x86_linux))]\nfn foo() { /* ... */ }\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">#!<span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span>cfg_alias<span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">    x86_linux<span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">    all<span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>any<span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>target_arch = <span class=\"pl-s\">\"x86\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> target_arch = <span class=\"pl-s\">\"x86_64\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">,</span> target_os = <span class=\"pl-s\">\"linux\"</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\"><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">#<span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span>cfg<span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>x86_linux<span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">fn</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">foo</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">/* ... */</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">#<span class=\"pl-kos\">[</span>cfg<span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>not<span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span>x86_linux<span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">fn</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">foo</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">(</span><span class=\"pl-kos\">)</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">{</span> <span class=\"pl-c\">/* ... */</span> <span class=\"pl-kos\">}</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Previous discussion:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"57342123\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/issues/831\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/rust-lang/rfcs/issues/831/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/issues/831\">#831</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2545153202\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/130780\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/rust-lang/rust/pull/130780/hovercard?comment_id=2822439922&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/130780#issuecomment-2822439922\">rust-lang/rust#130780 (comment)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://rust-lang.zulipchat.com/#narrow/channel/213817-t-lang/topic/cfg.20aliases/with/433335771\" rel=\"nofollow\">#t-lang &gt; cfg aliases</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://internals.rust-lang.org/t/pre-rfc-cfg-attribute-alias/7404/16\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://internals.rust-lang.org/t/pre-rfc-cfg-attribute-alias/7404/16</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/tgross35/rfcs/blob/cfg-alias/text/3804-cfg-alias.md\">Rendered</a></p>",
